5041","bead_id":"bob-cli-9u.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-9u[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Underline emphasis inside highlights[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]An underline drawn inside a highlight renders as bold emphasis [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inside that highlight's quote in Obsidian, bob ref show, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Bob Mac Capture preview. Its comment, tasks, and image notes join [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the highlight, anchors stay valid, and nothing is written to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]PDF or the sidecar.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]underline_emphasis.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/underline_emphasis.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9u[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9u/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Classify, match, and fold underlines into their highlights[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fold-render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-render: add underline.rs (classifier, match key, host predicate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]word-snapped runs), plan underlines before continuations in one shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold plan, render runs, comments, image notes, and task links into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]host block, absorb underline IDs with link-aware Merged emphasis stubs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]heal standalone underlines, and rehearse the rollout on a scratch copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the affected notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scan counters, terminal bold, docs, and the Obsidian snippet[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fold-render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibility-docs: report merged and standalone underlines (with reasons) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in dry-run, scan, and JSON output; render quote emphasis as ANSI bold in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob ref show; document the feature; install and enable the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ref-highlights.css vault snippet.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Emphasis-aware quote preview in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-preview: a pure RefsCore excerpt that keeps late emphasis inside the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]4-line inspector preview, a plain-text quote tooltip, and bold runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of raw `**` in the Copy card picker.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-9u","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-9u.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-11f8ef4399736a8eb658eae3136d2b5b","started_at":"2026-10-19T15:54:28.595064+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"7a6ccd1007f6433b13ee16e015cf2060fc4b7bcac616486a17e7dcfaca378d6c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9u.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-9u.3/embedded_workfl